{"3491960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": " Lost Liminal", "steam_appid": 3491960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>           This is a single-player linear plot horror game, currently still in active development and updates.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>     If you have any questions, please join our DISCORD or other social media links and contact us promptly!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/978176d17550bb07e8a7c9ad855e9a02.poster.avif?t=1788008172\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/978176d17550bb07e8a7c9ad855e9a02.webm?t=1788008172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>         When you wake up from a car crash, you find yourself trapped in an incomprehensible liminal space.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   Here, you will take on the role of an ordinary person named &quot;George&quot; — navigate this ever-changing world to recover your past memories, master the &quot;rules of each space&quot;, and fight to survive.You will encounter not only a variety of landscapes and unique environments, but also ferocious and dangerous hostile entities, or even the &quot;Old Gods&quot; hiding in the depths, harassing your nerves every moment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>        Accept or refuse, escape or resist — choose carefully! Your decisions will determine not only your own fate, but also who will control the real world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/9b3141c9984a4e95cf8dc932040cc208.poster.avif?t=1788008172\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/9b3141c9984a4e95cf8dc932040cc208.webm?t=1788008172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/9b3141c9984a4e95cf8dc932040cc208.mp4?t=1788008172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/03359b77483ba8aef8b7b0c36e0d70ba.avif?t=1788008172\" width=1400 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/b463ae31ed7ce0a984ae4275389b85c6.poster.avif?t=1788008172\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/b463ae31ed7ce0a984ae4275389b85c6.webm?t=1788008172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/b463ae31ed7ce0a984ae4275389b85c6.mp4?t=1788008172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                      <strong>This unknown territory is stitched together from countless misaligned spaces.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>         One moment, you're treading on the rotting carpet of a cheap motel, the hallway ending in peeling wallpaper and a flickering fluorescent tube; the next, you push open a door and stumble into a seventeenth-century library thick with dust, the ceiling frescoes fading into blurred shadows. Turn again, and you might find yourself in some abandoned nineties office—empty, derelict, monitors glowing a sickly green, the air heavy with paper rot and mildew.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>          The pressure builds in silence, clinging to the back of your neck like a shadow. There's no turning back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have no choice but to pass through door after door, through rooms that belong to no era and no place, until you find the answer hidden in every crack between them. The monster's voice coils around you, the scenery keeps shifting and compressing—all you can do is adapt and keep moving forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/0094d7cf02945ee4094755a44240c79d.avif?t=1788008172\" width=1400 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/0ebd9a6f4b6327a8f0c50adaf9944eaf.poster.avif?t=1788008172\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/0ebd9a6f4b6327a8f0c50adaf9944eaf.webm?t=1788008172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/0ebd9a6f4b6327a8f0c50adaf9944eaf.mp4?t=1788008172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>                                                             Every step you take shapes your fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                Choose your words, solve the puzzles, see through the illusions, and outwit the horrors that stalk you. <br>In this place, <br>                                                               --You can trust no one — only yourself.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/3a48397fe217eae20a5d3ad4aeca4807.avif?t=1788008172\" width=1400 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/c2891fe2852f43782967286368b59a26.poster.avif?t=1788008172\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/c2891fe2852f43782967286368b59a26.webm?t=1788008172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491960/extras/c2891fe2852f43782967286368b59a26.mp4?t=1788008172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                                                               - Evil TV monsters wandering the office,<br>                                                   - &quot;Cute&quot; snowmen hiding in the night of the snow village, <br>                                                     -   Or even the &quot;mastermind&quot; lurking in the shadows —<br> <br>                                                         Remember, if you don’t have a sure chance of winning, <br>                 Always keep your distance from them! Any carelessness will lead to irreversible consequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>           This is a single-player linear plot horror game, cu